      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS MUSCLE (5) went well to finish second two starts ago then registered a comfortable victory last time out, scoring by 6 metres over 2100m at Geelong. Tackles a similar assignment and she can go right on with the job. TAURAS (6) went to the front in the early stages and kept going to record a commanding 20 metres win last start over 2200m at Horsham after a second two starts back at this track. Tackles a similar assignment and he can go right on with the job. RAPTA (3) did a good job to finish in the minor placings two runs back then his luck changed last time when he broke and finished a long way back in 12th over 1720m at Melton. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Has the talent to make his presence felt. CALLINAN (1) could only finish sixth over 1700m at Horsham most recently. Open to improvement and is in the mix.",
